<title>USA: Morgan Stanley Group Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley Group Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.88		    $1.64</p>
<p> Shr diluted     $1.80		    $1.57</p>
<p> Net		 316			273</p>
<p> Revs		4,076		    3,308</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary158,307,567	    156,549,243</p>
<p>(All data above millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Latest Q1 earnings excluding amortization of goodwill for acquisitions in fiscal 1996 of  Miller Anderson &amp; Sherrerd LLP and  Van Kampen American Capital Inc were $1.93 per share on a primary basis, and $1.85 fully diluted.</p>
<p>Period ended Feb 28.</p>
